                    {
                        "form_id": "b58c969d-4696-4033-9074-38d6f5762ab5",
                        "entry_id": "2034b642-ae72-37f8-9921-b382feb1faf6",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "sapiosexuelles"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a706877c-8629-31b9-9f97-3b648efee9fe",
                        "entry_id": "2034b642-ae72-37f8-9921-b382feb1faf6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relatif à la sapiosexualité, qui est attiré par les personnes perçues comme intelligentes."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0cb6836-5acf-4c2c-87e0-cbc485da7bbe",
                                "sense_id": "a706877c-8629-31b9-9f97-3b648efee9fe",
                                "text": "De manière régulière, je préfère une discussion authentique et des bisous dans le cou qui dérapent à une séance de démonstration de performances de mon partenaire – aurais-je un côté sapiosexuel ?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2231bc42-d37f-4f21-a96f-148f3711e2bd",
                                "sense_id": "a706877c-8629-31b9-9f97-3b648efee9fe",
                                "text": "Ce qui vous attire sexuellement chez un homme c’est plutôt sa vivacité intellectuelle, sa culture et ses connaissances dans des sujets divers et variés ?\nCôté préliminaires vous préférez largement un débat enflammé à des caresses sur des zones érogènes insoupçonnées ? Vous êtes donc sapiosexuelle !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "49fa4354-4575-4831-8d45-1351b809821a",
                                "sense_id": "a706877c-8629-31b9-9f97-3b648efee9fe",
                                "text": "Une personne sapiosexuelle (contraction du mot latin sapiens et de sexualité) met en avant l’intelligence comme premier critère pour choisir ses partenaires sexuels."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f727da23-f79a-46c5-b6bc-905e4c2aec74",
                        "source_entry_id": "2034b642-ae72-37f8-9921-b382feb1faf6",
                        "source_sense_id": "a706877c-8629-31b9-9f97-3b648efee9fe",
                        "target_lang_word": "sapiosexual",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sapiosexual",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2ac418bc-12be-319e-95cc-3dd08ae4d6e6",
                                        "entry_id": "00e97854-e59a-31f5-85f9-984fba4dbb81",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sexually attracted to intellectual or mental qualities over appearance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "836d5cef-da8c-4bbb-8614-b0e30156403b",
                                                "sense_id": "2ac418bc-12be-319e-95cc-3dd08ae4d6e6",
                                                "text": "I am what is known as a sapiosexual—defined by Urban Dictionary as one who finds intelligence the most sexually attractive feature."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8ba28a5-202e-41f5-8aa1-06feff30d2a0",
                                                "sense_id": "2ac418bc-12be-319e-95cc-3dd08ae4d6e6",
                                                "text": "For Mr. Okeke-Diagne, being sapiosexual means intellectual conversation is a key part of dating and sex."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9938b6de-8f9b-4a94-adbc-208efcc5ff14",
                                                "sense_id": "2ac418bc-12be-319e-95cc-3dd08ae4d6e6",
                                                "text": "Sexually attracted to intelligent people? You're sapiosexual."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "sapiosexual",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "382d390b-5d8f-388d-9d90-9885b82ac11f",
                                        "entry_id": "074fd61b-75af-378b-90f3-a52126d4b28a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who is sapiosexual."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57e991da-e573-4554-827f-03a9e462926e",
                                                "sense_id": "382d390b-5d8f-388d-9d90-9885b82ac11f",
                                                "text": "You see, for a true geek there's often little difference, because when you engage our brains, which are connected to our genitals, it often turns on our lust response (we're quite often sapiosexuals - people who lust after intellect first), but it's the *brain* you aim for, the intellect, to turn us on, not our genitals."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc0d3f71-c80e-42af-9f3a-0d31c24f3afb",
                                                "sense_id": "382d390b-5d8f-388d-9d90-9885b82ac11f",
                                                "text": "In Study 2 we tapped attitudes toward a largely unknown sexual orientation group, sapiosexuals (those sexually attracted to the human mind).\n[…]\nParticipants indicated their familiarity with heterosexuals, homosexuals, bisexuals, asexuals, and sapiosexuals […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a259380-8db5-4311-bcb5-59dd05df9750",
                                                "sense_id": "382d390b-5d8f-388d-9d90-9885b82ac11f",
                                                "text": "So, what attracts you? What turns you on? If you decided on abstract thought, clever humour and insight. You're a sapiosexual."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "659d49af-b12c-4a58-b462-200b85039c19",
                        "source_entry_id": "2034b642-ae72-37f8-9921-b382feb1faf6",
                        "source_sense_id": "a706877c-8629-31b9-9f97-3b648efee9fe",
                        "target_lang_word": "sapiosexual",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
